    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21584" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαμφηλαί</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶν</span>, αἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>jaws</i> of animals, as of the lion, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.489
			</span></i>; of the horse, <i><span class="en">
				19.394
			</span></i>; of Typhon, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				357
			</span></i>; <i>bill</i> or <i>beak</i> of birds, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				159
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. Ps.-Orac. in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				198
			</span></i>: as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ
				γαμφηλῇσιν ὀδοῦσιν</span> (sic) <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				5.187
			</span></i> (s. v. l.): once in sg., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαμφηλή: ἡ
				γνάθος ἢ σιαγών</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				221.13
			</span></i>.</div>
